    "html": "<p>Zuri is flying a spacecraft at speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. For this speed, the Lorentz factor is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span>. The navigation lights on the spacecraft flash every <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\\;\\textup{s}\"></span>. Ariadne watches the spacecraft fly by.</p>\n<p>What is the time that Ariadne observes between the flashes?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.5\\;\\textup{s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\;\\textup{s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"7.0\\;\\textup{s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\\;\\textup{s}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
